  "sources": [
    {
      "source": "HOKFIRE",
      "url": "https://www.hokfire.com/",
      "field": "abilities",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "Passive",
          "name": "Mechanical Minions",
          "desc": "Summons minions upon killing a unit. Minions attack automatically, then merge into an advanced bot or explode at the end of their duration, dealing damage to nearby enemies."
        },
        {
          "type": "Skill 1",
          "name": "Air Superiority",
          "desc": "Commands her aircraft to move in the target direction, dealing damage to enemies in its path. Using the skill again splits the aircraft in two, dealing damage and inflicting slow."
        },
        {
          "type": "Skill 2",
          "name": "Forced Invasion",
          "desc": "Summons mechanical minions in the target area, dealing area damage before automatically attacking nearby enemies."
        },
        {
          "type": "Ultimate",
          "name": "Chaos Field",
          "desc": "Marks a target enemy or structure, damaging them over time. Non-structures are also stunned and slowed. Nearby mechanical minions are enhanced while marks are active. Marks explode upon expiry, dealing damage proportional to the damage taken while marked."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "HOKFIRE",
      "url": "https://www.hokfire.com/",
      "field": "guide",
      "content": {
        "pros": [
          "Fast wave clear",
          "Strong siege potential with robots",
          "Good poke damage"
        ],
        "cons": [
          "Low Mobility",
          "Useless without robots",
          "Falls off late game"
        ],
        "gameplay_tips": "## Early Game\nMilady has no reliable wave clear early on. You will need to sit under the tower for the first few levels and wait until you have a few robots to help you out. It's vital that you last-hit minions to spawn robots thanks to your passive. After pushing the wave, look for roams to help your jungle or by going into another lane.\n\n## Teamfights\nIn teamfights, summon your robots early so they can deal damage throughout the fight. Stay behind your backline and use your skills and Ultimate on the first enemy in front of you.\n\n## Tips & Tricks\nUse your robots to tank tower shots and help you push towers faster\nMake sure to use Skill 1 Air Superiority a 2nd time to split the aircraft for more damage and to slow the enemies\nYour robots can tank enemy jungle camps, making it easier for you to take them away"
      }
    },
    {
      "source": "Kurohiko",
      "url": "https://hok.kurohiko.id/",
      "field": "tactical_tips",
      "content": "1) Minion mekanik cuma hidup 8 detik, jadi tarik fight ke tempat jauh dan bunuh Milady pas dia lagi nyiapin minion. 2) Pakai tank yang punya dash buat nahan ult dan damage-nya, biar ult dan minion gak ngunci carry tim. Ancaman teamfight-nya langsung turun."
    },
